{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42206","headline":"赋得风光草际浮 · 徐铉","name":"赋得风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿露依芳草，春郊古陌旁。\n风轻不尽偃，日早未曦阳。\n耿耿依平远，离离入望长。\n映空无定彩，飘迳有余光。\n颭若荷珠乱，纷如爝火扬。\n诗人多感物，凝思绕池塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}